1
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Silent Storm]</font>

2
00:01:33,430 --> 00:01:34,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao,</font>

3
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the society and I</font>

4
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:37,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">both want you</font>

5
00:01:38,070 --> 00:01:39,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to go back to the mainland</font>

6
00:01:39,790 --> 00:01:40,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to manage Dongle.</font>

7
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:44,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officially, the return is coming soon.</font>

8
00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Three months ago, Hong Kong, China]</font>

9
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:47,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The days of fighting
and killing can't go on.</font>

10
00:01:48,230 --> 00:01:50,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The society needs to plan
its mainland business ahead of time.</font>

11
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Privately,</font>

12
00:01:53,070 --> 00:01:54,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we originally arranged for Li Ahong</font>

13
00:01:54,950 --> 00:01:56,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to launder money at Dongle</font>

14
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and distribute goods.</font>

15
00:01:58,070 --> 00:01:59,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet, she sold Dongle's goods</font>

16
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">nationwide as genuine goods.</font>

17
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All the Lin family's money
went into her account.</font>

18
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle belongs to the Lin family;</font>

19
00:02:08,590 --> 00:02:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it surely should return
to the Lin family.</font>

20
00:02:12,150 --> 00:02:13,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once she gains real power,</font>

21
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid even I won't be able
to keep her in check.</font>

22
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:20,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've always handled
the smuggling route into the mainland.</font>

23
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But on the mainland,
she has home-field advantage:</font>

24
00:02:23,150 --> 00:02:24,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">timing, place, and people.</font>

25
00:02:24,870 --> 00:02:25,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once she grows strong,</font>

26
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:27,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">forget about taking her down.</font>

27
00:02:28,430 --> 00:02:29,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid
you won't even get the scraps.</font>

28
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:34,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

29
00:02:35,190 --> 00:02:35,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll handle it.</font>

30
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 7]</font>

31
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:48,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master,</font>

32
00:02:49,150 --> 00:02:51,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to investigate Dongle further.</font>

33
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On what grounds?</font>

34
00:02:53,710 --> 00:02:54,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These past two days,</font>

35
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Xiangda Liquor]
I visited some merchants.</font>

36
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about this one?</font>

37
00:02:58,150 --> 00:02:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one's expensive,
but I can give you a rebate.</font>

38
00:03:10,590 --> 00:03:12,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle buys Aike's tobacco and liquor</font>

39
00:03:12,710 --> 00:03:13,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at prices above market rate.</font>

40
00:03:14,470 --> 00:03:15,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not normal.</font>

41
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong with that?</font>

42
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much they pay for stock</font>

43
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and whether anyone takes kickbacks</font>

44
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:27,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are internal business matters.</font>

45
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:28,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not our concern.</font>

46
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You brat.</font>

47
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:32,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I already had
the tax collection people check.</font>

48
00:03:32,750 --> 00:03:34,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle's tax payments
over all these years</font>

49
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are way too low.</font>

50
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:37,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't match the company's scale.</font>

51
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's definitely a problem.</font>

52
00:03:39,710 --> 00:03:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we can pull up</font>

53
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the radish and bring the mud with it,</font>

54
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can round them all up in one sweep.</font>

55
00:03:45,710 --> 00:03:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

56
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who told you</font>

57
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to check their tax payments?</font>

58
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who told you?</font>

59
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you to attend the training.</font>

60
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why won't you listen?</font>

61
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:57,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put down all the work you have</font>

62
00:03:58,710 --> 00:03:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and study hard.</font>

63
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:03,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not going.
I'm investigating the case.</font>

64
00:04:03,430 --> 00:04:04,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have Wang Zhou attend that stupid class.</font>

65
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not going.</font>

66
00:04:05,030 --> 00:04:06,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're out of line.</font>

67
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have
any discipline awareness left?</font>

68
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Without orders from above,</font>

69
00:04:09,470 --> 00:04:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you just investigate whatever you want?</font>

70
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is no one managing you anymore?</font>

71
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. Today, I'll straighten you out.</font>

72
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:16,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here. Come.</font>

73
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Comrade Zhang Haiyuan, let me tell you.</font>

74
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a public bathhouse.</font>

75
00:04:20,190 --> 00:04:21,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This isn't the office or your home.</font>

76
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop putting on that leader act.</font>

77
00:04:23,310 --> 00:04:24,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you yelling at me for?</font>

78
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't care what place this is.
Come here.</font>

79
00:04:26,190 --> 00:04:27,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can come here if you want.</font>

80
00:04:27,190 --> 00:04:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. Then I'll come over.</font>

81
00:04:30,950 --> 00:04:31,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead and beat me, then.</font>

82
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:32,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get down!</font>

83
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master...</font>

84
00:04:38,310 --> 00:04:38,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

85
00:04:40,430 --> 00:04:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me take a look.</font>

86
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't beat you anymore.</font>

87
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gently.</font>

88
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:01,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gently.</font>

89
00:05:04,510 --> 00:05:06,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, stop sulking.</font>

90
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:09,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't let you scrub my back
for nothing today.</font>

91
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll tell you what.</font>

92
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to the local tax bureau.</font>

93
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I plan to take you
and Wang Zhou with me.</font>

94
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

95
00:05:23,750 --> 00:05:25,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two were both trained by me.</font>

96
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One calm, one restless.</font>

97
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should make a great team.</font>

98
00:05:28,430 --> 00:05:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm about to retire.</font>

99
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

100
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't you learn from Wang Zhou?</font>

101
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's mature and steady.</font>

102
00:05:40,430 --> 00:05:42,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the one I worry about most,
you brat.</font>

103
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid you'll be too clever
for your own good.</font>

104
00:05:45,430 --> 00:05:46,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sending you to training</font>

105
00:05:46,870 --> 00:05:48,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to temper and discipline you.</font>

106
00:05:49,190 --> 00:05:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you understand?</font>

107
00:05:51,190 --> 00:05:51,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

108
00:06:07,870 --> 00:06:09,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You seem off your game today.</font>

109
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I stayed in the sauna too long
with my master yesterday.</font>

110
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang Haiyuan, right?</font>

111
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:15,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know him?</font>

112
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the entire Linhai tax system,</font>

113
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who doesn't know him?</font>

114
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:19,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then have you heard</font>

115
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the story of him giving someone a sauna?</font>

116
00:06:21,870 --> 00:06:22,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A sauna?</font>

117
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:24,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me about it.</font>

118
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Northeast China, 1960s]</font>

119
00:06:28,070 --> 00:06:28,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Zhang.</font>

120
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On such a freezing day,</font>

121
00:06:30,310 --> 00:06:31,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you called everyone here.</font>

122
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you trying to make us pay taxes?</font>

123
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:35,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just doing my job.</font>

124
00:06:35,390 --> 00:06:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll read it out for you all.</font>

125
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When my master first started working,</font>

126
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some stubborn merchants pleaded poverty
and refused to pay taxes.</font>

127
00:06:41,510 --> 00:06:44,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My master paid out of his own pocket
for sunflower seeds and peanuts</font>

128
00:06:44,630 --> 00:06:47,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and gathered those merchants together
in the dead of winter</font>

129
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to have a tea party.</font>

130
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To pretend they were poor, they all came
wearing tattered padded jackets.</font>

131
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My master saw through it
but said nothing.</font>

132
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:53,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He just took a small booklet</font>

133
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and slowly explained the policy to them,</font>

134
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:58,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while quietly heating the kang
until it was scorching.</font>

135
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Taxpayers and withholding agents</font>

136
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:13,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must accept supervision and inspection
by the tax authorities.</font>

137
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to open the window.
It won't open.</font>

138
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With doors closed and windows shut,</font>

139
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a long meeting can be kept short.</font>

140
00:07:18,190 --> 00:07:18,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

141
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:20,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you trying to roast us?</font>

142
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:21,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you're hot,
just take off your padded jackets.</font>

143
00:07:22,310 --> 00:07:23,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show your true selves.</font>

144
00:07:24,310 --> 00:07:26,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at that thick gold chain of yours.</font>

145
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:28,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dripping in gold and silver,
draped in silk and satin.</font>

146
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:31,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our country is still poor
and underdeveloped.</font>

147
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything is waiting to be rebuilt.</font>

148
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:35,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As citizens, we also have obligations.</font>

149
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's for the country</font>

150
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:37,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and for ourselves.</font>

151
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When the country does well,
everyone does well.</font>

152
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This... We can't take it.</font>

153
00:07:40,870 --> 00:07:42,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This kang is too hot.</font>

154
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you should know</font>

155
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:43,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what to do now.</font>

156
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:45,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't need to spell it out, do I?</font>

157
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you're hot,
just hold on a little longer.</font>

158
00:07:47,390 --> 00:07:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang.</font>

159
00:07:48,390 --> 00:07:49,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I give up.</font>

160
00:07:49,390 --> 00:07:50,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much?</font>

161
00:07:50,390 --> 00:07:51,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pay it.</font>

162
00:07:51,070 --> 00:07:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sign it, and you can leave.</font>

163
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You actually signed it?</font>

164
00:07:53,870 --> 00:07:54,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can get off the kang now.</font>

165
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:56,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since he already paid,</font>

166
00:07:56,070 --> 00:07:56,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll pay too.</font>

167
00:07:56,830 --> 00:07:57,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Then I'll sign too.
- Me too.</font>

168
00:07:57,950 --> 00:07:58,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Zhang</font>

169
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really has a lot of tricks.</font>

170
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

171
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll sign along too.</font>

172
00:08:06,510 --> 00:08:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The heated kangs
in the Northeast are the best.</font>

173
00:08:08,510 --> 00:08:09,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After that one steaming session,</font>

174
00:08:10,070 --> 00:08:11,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even my master's hemorrhoids got cured.</font>

175
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:14,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

176
00:08:16,070 --> 00:08:17,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was so painful.</font>

177
00:08:17,270 --> 00:08:18,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't say I told you.</font>

178
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then your master</font>

179
00:08:21,270 --> 00:08:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be a very wise man.</font>

180
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:28,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To me, he's like a teacher and a father.</font>

181
00:08:29,950 --> 00:08:31,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he's been acting
really strange lately.</font>

182
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:32,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He keeps watching me during class,</font>

183
00:08:32,790 --> 00:08:34,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he won't even let me
investigate cases.</font>

184
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:36,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what if the national
and local tax offices split?</font>

185
00:08:37,270 --> 00:08:38,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why won't you let me investigate Dongle?</font>

186
00:08:39,390 --> 00:08:40,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to me.</font>

187
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your father handed you over to me.</font>

188
00:08:42,750 --> 00:08:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I brought you from the north
to Chunjiang.</font>

189
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In uniform, I'm your master.</font>

190
00:08:46,510 --> 00:08:47,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Out of uniform, I'm your father.</font>

191
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whether we investigate is up to me.</font>

192
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:51,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Tang,</font>

193
00:08:52,030 --> 00:08:54,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I actually have a favor to ask you.</font>

194
00:08:55,630 --> 00:08:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

195
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd like you to help me
investigate Dongle Manor undercover.</font>

196
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you want to investigate Dongle,</font>

197
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must have solid evidence,</font>

198
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the facts must be clear.</font>

199
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I want to start
with an undercover visit</font>

200
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to minimize the negative impact.</font>

201
00:09:13,790 --> 00:09:16,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I'm no longer working
on the front line.</font>

202
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Helping you like this
would be a violation.</font>

203
00:09:19,510 --> 00:09:20,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Precisely because you're not
on the front line,</font>

204
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're the most suitable person to help.</font>

205
00:09:23,390 --> 00:09:24,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've asked the leadership for approval.</font>

206
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:33,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That lady over there isn't one
of our members, is she?</font>

207
00:09:34,150 --> 00:09:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

208
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should we ask her to leave?</font>

209
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:39,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave? Leave for what?</font>

210
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:42,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With a guest like that,
I'd want her here every day.</font>

211
00:09:48,550 --> 00:09:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss, excuse me.</font>

212
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Wan Guoquan, the manager here.</font>

213
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I give you an introduction</font>

214
00:09:54,510 --> 00:09:55,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to our Dongle Manor?</font>

215
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:56,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

216
00:09:57,270 --> 00:09:58,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our Dongle Manor</font>

217
00:09:58,270 --> 00:09:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is currently the best</font>

218
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:02,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">golf and entertainment complex
in all of Asia.</font>

219
00:10:02,550 --> 00:10:04,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We currently operate
on a membership system.</font>

220
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you think our place is good</font>

221
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you have spending needs,</font>

222
00:10:08,790 --> 00:10:10,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can apply for our membership card.</font>

223
00:10:10,510 --> 00:10:11,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Each card is ten thousand.</font>

224
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:13,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And we'll also give you</font>

225
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an extra 50 hours of practice time.</font>

226
00:10:17,270 --> 00:10:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ten thousand each?</font>

227
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That face value is way too small.</font>

228
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I usually like to entertain friends.</font>

229
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ten thousand is nowhere near enough.</font>

230
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have any higher-tier cards here?</font>

231
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The only card
we currently sell domestically</font>

232
00:10:28,910 --> 00:10:29,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is this one.</font>

233
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But don't worry.</font>

234
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:33,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the balance on your card runs out,</font>

235
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can apply for a new one.</font>

236
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:37,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However, each member per year</font>

237
00:10:37,670 --> 00:10:38,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is limited to three applications.</font>

238
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:40,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only three times?</font>

239
00:10:40,150 --> 00:10:40,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

240
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I get a membership card abroad,</font>

241
00:10:45,150 --> 00:10:46,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it has points and tiers,</font>

242
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with no restrictions at all.</font>

243
00:10:48,270 --> 00:10:50,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are the rules here really that strange?</font>

244
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you think?</font>

245
00:10:52,550 --> 00:10:54,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pass your feedback to our boss,</font>

246
00:10:54,670 --> 00:10:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but right now,</font>

247
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:57,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we only have this one type of card.</font>

248
00:11:19,670 --> 00:11:20,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How should I address you?</font>

249
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you?</font>

250
00:11:30,390 --> 00:11:31,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can call me Tianbao.</font>

251
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:32,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle</font>

252
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:33,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is mine.</font>

253
00:11:37,670 --> 00:11:38,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is whiskey okay?</font>

254
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's okay.</font>

255
00:11:51,390 --> 00:11:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

256
00:11:52,270 --> 00:11:52,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

257
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:55,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle truly is</font>

258
00:11:55,150 --> 00:11:56,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Asia's best golf course.</font>

259
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if you can only get a basic card,</font>

260
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:01,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you probably can't even cover
the maintenance costs.</font>

261
00:12:02,670 --> 00:12:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need. Getting a premium membership
is such a hassle.</font>

262
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need two members to recommend you.</font>

263
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on, when you come,</font>

264
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just put it on my tab.</font>

265
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

266
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a businesswoman.</font>

267
00:12:17,870 --> 00:12:19,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where I play</font>

268
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and what kind of friends I make</font>

269
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">matter a lot.</font>

270
00:12:22,510 --> 00:12:23,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I'd still like</font>

271
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a membership card of my own.</font>

272
00:12:31,510 --> 00:12:32,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you really like it here?</font>

273
00:12:34,270 --> 00:12:34,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

274
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First time here?</font>

275
00:12:58,030 --> 00:12:58,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

276
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you ready to accept me
as a new member?</font>

277
00:13:01,030 --> 00:13:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd rather be your friend.</font>

278
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall we play</font>

279
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a few rounds?</font>

280
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't played in a long time.</font>

281
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:10,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid I'll embarrass myself.</font>

282
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:13,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. We'll just play casually.</font>

283
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:26,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then,</font>

284
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll really embarrass myself.</font>

285
00:13:29,030 --> 00:13:29,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't laugh at me, okay?</font>

286
00:13:52,750 --> 00:13:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't even get the ball up.</font>

287
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:59,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't played much since I came back.</font>

288
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a bit rusty.</font>

289
00:14:03,870 --> 00:14:04,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can tell.</font>

290
00:14:08,870 --> 00:14:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

291
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll show you around.</font>

292
00:14:31,870 --> 00:14:32,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

293
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:34,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you here?</font>

294
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:39,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did your master send you
to secretly investigate Dongle?</font>

295
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not right.</font>

296
00:14:44,270 --> 00:14:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I specifically asked him
to let you join the task force.</font>

297
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:47,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he disagreed.</font>

298
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:49,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you come to investigate
behind his back?</font>

299
00:14:50,910 --> 00:14:51,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll tell you later.</font>

300
00:14:52,670 --> 00:14:54,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came with a teacher
from our tax school.</font>

301
00:14:54,510 --> 00:14:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked her to help look into Dongle.</font>

302
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The tax teacher?</font>

303
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:02,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it her?</font>

304
00:15:03,630 --> 00:15:04,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

305
00:15:04,150 --> 00:15:05,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A female teacher?</font>

306
00:15:06,510 --> 00:15:06,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

307
00:15:06,750 --> 00:15:08,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would she be with Cheng Tianbao?</font>

308
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:09,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is Cheng Tianbao?</font>

309
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheng Tianbao, alias Tianbao.</font>

310
00:15:11,030 --> 00:15:12,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A Hong Kong (China) society member.</font>

311
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a dangerous person.</font>

312
00:15:13,390 --> 00:15:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've been watching him for a long time.</font>

313
00:15:18,150 --> 00:15:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, what do we do now?</font>

314
00:15:19,550 --> 00:15:20,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's here to help.</font>

315
00:15:20,510 --> 00:15:21,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing can go wrong.</font>

316
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think of something.</font>

317
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:23,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You come to me now?</font>

318
00:15:23,670 --> 00:15:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want me to think of something?</font>

319
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What can I do?</font>

320
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:26,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think of something.</font>

321
00:15:26,550 --> 00:15:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then beg me.</font>

322
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:28,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, please.</font>

323
00:15:30,270 --> 00:15:31,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. I'll think of something.</font>

324
00:16:10,670 --> 00:16:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not here to get a card.</font>

325
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:19,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

326
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:21,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

327
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you say you came back
from abroad?</font>

328
00:16:30,510 --> 00:16:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like your type.</font>

329
00:16:32,960 --> 00:16:33,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're my type.</font>

330
00:16:40,550 --> 00:16:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

331
00:16:41,630 --> 00:16:43,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've seen all kinds of women.</font>

332
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wouldn't force me, would you?</font>

333
00:17:06,350 --> 00:17:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

334
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you chase a moment of pleasure,</font>

335
00:17:09,550 --> 00:17:11,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll lose me as a premium client,</font>

336
00:17:12,070 --> 00:17:13,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and all the resources behind me.</font>

337
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sure you want to do this?</font>

338
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

339
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wanted to come to Dongle
for some fun</font>

340
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and get a membership card.</font>

341
00:17:38,070 --> 00:17:39,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get me a card if you can.</font>

342
00:17:40,030 --> 00:17:41,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not, it's no big deal to me.</font>

343
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:43,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no need for such a fuss.</font>

344
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:43,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get you a card.</font>

345
00:17:45,030 --> 00:17:45,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much for the face value?</font>

346
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:48,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five hundred thousand?</font>

347
00:17:48,750 --> 00:17:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A million?</font>

348
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:50,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five million?</font>

349
00:17:51,350 --> 00:17:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can get you any kind.</font>

350
00:17:57,030 --> 00:17:57,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any of those works for me.</font>

351
00:17:58,720 --> 00:17:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do I pay?</font>

352
00:17:59,590 --> 00:18:00,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cash,</font>

353
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:01,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">domestic account,</font>

354
00:18:01,590 --> 00:18:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">overseas account...</font>

355
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:03,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any works for me.</font>

356
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But a domestic account is best.</font>

357
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:10,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, you'd have
to charge me a transfer fee.</font>

358
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:24,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao, the police are here again.</font>

359
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do we do?</font>

360
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold on.</font>

361
00:18:49,270 --> 00:18:51,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to leave. Make yourself at home.</font>

362
00:19:38,590 --> 00:19:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Tang.</font>

363
00:19:40,750 --> 00:19:41,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Tang.</font>

364
00:19:46,030 --> 00:19:46,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

365
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:48,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

366
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:55,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Tang, what's wrong?</font>

367
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Tang, what happened?</font>

368
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Tang, don't scare me.</font>

369
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:06,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay now.</font>

370
00:20:07,750 --> 00:20:08,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be afraid. I'm here.</font>

371
00:20:08,830 --> 00:20:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be afraid.</font>

372
00:20:12,350 --> 00:20:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu.</font>

373
00:20:15,270 --> 00:20:15,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Ms. Tang.</font>

374
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:17,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Tang.</font>

375
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's definitely</font>

376
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:20,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a problem with Dongle.</font>

377
00:20:21,350 --> 00:20:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The problem is very serious.</font>

378
00:20:23,070 --> 00:20:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Cheng Tianbao right now?</font>

379
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:28,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Yan.</font>

380
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:30,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We tracked Cheng Tianbao's three cars.</font>

381
00:20:30,880 --> 00:20:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They left through the west gate.</font>

382
00:20:31,750 --> 00:20:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Follow me.</font>

383
00:20:36,070 --> 00:20:36,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

384
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:40,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

385
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Tang.</font>

386
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must formally apologize to you.</font>

387
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was too reckless.</font>

388
00:21:08,070 --> 00:21:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I almost got you hurt. I'm sorry.</font>

389
00:21:18,550 --> 00:21:19,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nothing to apologize for.</font>

390
00:21:20,750 --> 00:21:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I helped you with this willingly.</font>

391
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:26,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you always been in Chunjiang</font>

392
00:21:26,790 --> 00:21:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">working as a tax teacher?</font>

393
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it's not convenient, forget it.</font>

394
00:21:37,510 --> 00:21:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle might be more complicated
than you think.</font>

395
00:21:41,070 --> 00:21:41,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Getting a premium membership</font>

396
00:21:41,830 --> 00:21:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">requires two members' recommendations.</font>

397
00:21:44,310 --> 00:21:45,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I found out</font>

398
00:21:45,510 --> 00:21:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that besides the basic card,</font>

399
00:21:47,270 --> 00:21:48,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle also has many premium cards</font>

400
00:21:49,030 --> 00:21:50,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">worth hundreds of thousands
or even millions.</font>

401
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This money</font>

402
00:21:53,030 --> 00:21:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was probably all processed
through offshore accounts.</font>

403
00:21:56,070 --> 00:21:57,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That means they're using</font>

404
00:21:57,310 --> 00:21:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">their underground bank to launder money.</font>

405
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:01,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This could also be
their biggest illegal income source.</font>

406
00:22:03,030 --> 00:22:05,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The man called Tianbao that I met today</font>

407
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a dangerous character.</font>

408
00:22:09,350 --> 00:22:10,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These domestic premium members</font>

409
00:22:10,920 --> 00:22:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sent their money abroad</font>

410
00:22:12,310 --> 00:22:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and probably paid
their taxes overseas too.</font>

411
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not just tax evasion;</font>

412
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:17,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it also involves the issue
of tax sovereignty.</font>

413
00:22:18,200 --> 00:22:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the Dongle case is confirmed,</font>

414
00:22:20,160 --> 00:22:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it won't be small.</font>

415
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong.</font>

416
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you need?</font>

417
00:22:53,790 --> 00:22:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruyi has been kidnapped.</font>

418
00:22:55,920 --> 00:22:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who?</font>

419
00:22:57,440 --> 00:22:58,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you heard anything?</font>

420
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:00,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

421
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:06,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The kidnappers want 300,000.</font>

422
00:23:07,590 --> 00:23:08,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Money is not a problem,</font>

423
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I must know who did it.</font>

424
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:12,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

425
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll handle it.</font>

426
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five hundred thousand.</font>

427
00:23:34,960 --> 00:23:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it and get things done.</font>

428
00:23:36,750 --> 00:23:37,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong,</font>

429
00:23:38,160 --> 00:23:40,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't need your money
to get things done.</font>

430
00:23:43,360 --> 00:23:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wanhe Dance Hall]</font>

431
00:23:44,480 --> 00:23:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The address.</font>

432
00:23:48,590 --> 00:23:49,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait for my news.</font>

433
00:23:57,270 --> 00:23:59,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to hide.</font>

434
00:24:00,270 --> 00:24:03,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hide the longing in your heart.</font>

435
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let the sweet words fade.</font>

436
00:24:06,550 --> 00:24:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Okay
- Old sorrows pile up before my eyes.</font>

437
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like a soft sigh.</font>

438
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:17,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exhausting the tenderness of the past.</font>

439
00:24:17,310 --> 00:24:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who have you loved?</font>

440
00:24:17,920 --> 00:24:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, who are you looking for?</font>

441
00:24:19,440 --> 00:24:20,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here to ransom someone.</font>

442
00:24:20,720 --> 00:24:21,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Lin Ruyi?</font>

443
00:24:22,110 --> 00:24:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shuai.</font>

444
00:24:23,030 --> 00:24:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's looking for Lin Ruyi.</font>

445
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

446
00:24:30,070 --> 00:24:30,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you looking for?</font>

447
00:24:32,160 --> 00:24:34,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here to ransom Lin Ruyi.
Where is she?</font>

448
00:24:35,480 --> 00:24:36,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you do?</font>

449
00:24:36,590 --> 00:24:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None of your business.</font>

450
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is she?</font>

451
00:24:39,110 --> 00:24:39,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's the money?</font>

452
00:24:40,030 --> 00:24:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to see her first.</font>

453
00:24:41,270 --> 00:24:42,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's the money?</font>

454
00:25:00,440 --> 00:25:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you Lin Ruyi?</font>

455
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:03,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you?</font>

456
00:25:04,510 --> 00:25:05,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Ahong sent you, didn't she?</font>

457
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:07,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My name is Zhou Haiyang.</font>

458
00:25:08,310 --> 00:25:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait a moment.</font>

459
00:25:09,550 --> 00:25:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take you away right now.</font>

460
00:25:15,160 --> 00:25:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Release her.</font>

461
00:25:17,480 --> 00:25:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, sir.</font>

462
00:25:18,720 --> 00:25:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you?</font>

463
00:25:37,310 --> 00:25:37,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

464
00:25:37,750 --> 00:25:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Come on!
- You mess with me?</font>

465
00:25:40,440 --> 00:25:41,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have any morals?</font>

466
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:42,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Morals? Show him.</font>

467
00:25:43,590 --> 00:25:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the money you gave me?</font>

468
00:25:46,310 --> 00:25:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the 300,000 you brought.</font>

469
00:25:51,350 --> 00:25:51,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

470
00:25:52,550 --> 00:25:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll stay.</font>

471
00:25:53,510 --> 00:25:54,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just let her go.</font>

472
00:25:54,480 --> 00:25:55,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold him down!</font>

473
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:57,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just die!</font>

474
00:26:00,550 --> 00:26:01,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

475
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pull him up
and make him perform on stage.</font>

476
00:26:11,680 --> 00:26:14,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, time to perform!</font>

477
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which one is Shuai?</font>

478
00:27:53,830 --> 00:27:54,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you want?</font>

479
00:27:55,030 --> 00:27:55,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up.</font>

480
00:28:17,750 --> 00:28:19,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not going home. Go to Binhai Road.</font>

481
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:22,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Binhai Road? No.</font>

482
00:28:22,160 --> 00:28:23,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't get a fare on the way back.</font>

483
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's pure gold.</font>

484
00:28:31,510 --> 00:28:32,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, no problem.</font>

485
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come with me to Binhai Road first.</font>

486
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:35,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take you home later.</font>

487
00:28:47,480 --> 00:28:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Speed Knight House]</font>

488
00:29:07,590 --> 00:29:08,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruyi.</font>

489
00:29:09,160 --> 00:29:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you she was fine.</font>

490
00:29:10,750 --> 00:29:12,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You all worried for nothing.</font>

491
00:29:12,790 --> 00:29:13,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruyi!</font>

492
00:29:13,960 --> 00:29:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was so worried about you!</font>

493
00:29:16,270 --> 00:29:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

494
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:18,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, my foot!</font>

495
00:29:22,550 --> 00:29:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Ruyi!</font>

496
00:29:24,720 --> 00:29:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Ruyi!</font>

497
00:29:26,200 --> 00:29:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you crazy?</font>

498
00:29:26,750 --> 00:29:27,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When those people tied me up,</font>

499
00:29:27,550 --> 00:29:28,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you all just stood here watching.</font>

500
00:29:28,960 --> 00:29:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Were you blind or just scared stiff?</font>

501
00:29:30,200 --> 00:29:32,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How would I know who they were?</font>

502
00:29:32,070 --> 00:29:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not your first time being tied up.</font>

503
00:29:41,200 --> 00:29:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

504
00:29:42,030 --> 00:29:42,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move.</font>

505
00:29:43,750 --> 00:29:44,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move.</font>

506
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:46,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's mine.</font>

507
00:29:47,070 --> 00:29:48,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give it back.</font>

508
00:29:48,590 --> 00:29:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Ruyi, I'll kill you!</font>

509
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang.</font>

510
00:30:14,680 --> 00:30:15,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get on.</font>

511
00:30:18,640 --> 00:30:20,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold on tight, or you might fall.</font>

512
00:30:21,590 --> 00:30:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Ruyi.</font>

513
00:30:22,590 --> 00:30:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're a crazy woman.</font>

514
00:30:24,830 --> 00:30:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get lost.</font>

515
00:31:18,070 --> 00:31:19,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got your ring back for you.</font>

516
00:31:43,440 --> 00:31:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

517
00:32:04,200 --> 00:32:04,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

518
00:32:15,590 --> 00:32:16,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're quite popular.</font>

519
00:32:18,240 --> 00:32:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you going to ask me</font>

520
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:20,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why there's no money in the box?</font>

521
00:32:23,920 --> 00:32:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao, I'm sure</font>

522
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:26,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you did this for a reason.</font>

523
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is for you.</font>

524
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

525
00:32:50,270 --> 00:32:52,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I want a future with you,</font>

526
00:32:52,920 --> 00:32:53,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to risk my life.</font>

527
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:54,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't take</font>

528
00:32:55,750 --> 00:32:56,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this money.</font>

529
00:33:02,310 --> 00:33:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're lucky to be alive.</font>

530
00:33:37,480 --> 00:33:38,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

531
00:33:38,550 --> 00:33:39,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for your trouble.</font>

532
00:33:40,720 --> 00:33:41,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

533
00:33:42,240 --> 00:33:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Third Granduncle told me</font>

534
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:45,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to come and help.</font>

535
00:33:45,830 --> 00:33:46,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

536
00:33:47,440 --> 00:33:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruyi and Dongle</font>

537
00:33:49,270 --> 00:33:50,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are what I care about most right now.</font>

538
00:33:51,310 --> 00:33:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anyone dares to touch them,</font>

539
00:33:53,590 --> 00:33:54,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll fight them to the death.</font>

540
00:33:55,070 --> 00:33:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyone who dares to touch
Dongle and Ruyi</font>

541
00:33:58,270 --> 00:33:59,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will have to get through me first.</font>

542
00:34:00,680 --> 00:34:01,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I can rest easy.</font>

543
00:34:04,720 --> 00:34:05,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way,</font>

544
00:34:06,350 --> 00:34:08,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the guy who saved Ruyi is outside.</font>

545
00:34:08,400 --> 00:34:09,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have him come in and say hello.</font>

546
00:34:10,400 --> 00:34:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

547
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:13,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahua, have him come in.</font>

548
00:34:21,400 --> 00:34:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

549
00:34:22,440 --> 00:34:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Call her Ahong.</font>

550
00:34:25,360 --> 00:34:25,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong.</font>

551
00:34:26,880 --> 00:34:27,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What should I call you?</font>

552
00:34:35,440 --> 00:34:37,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My name is Zhou Haiyang.</font>

553
00:34:37,360 --> 00:34:38,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is our first meeting.</font>

554
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:39,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong, nice to meet you.</font>

555
00:34:46,960 --> 00:34:48,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for saving Ruyi.</font>

556
00:34:48,550 --> 00:34:49,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was my duty.</font>

557
00:34:50,670 --> 00:34:51,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a good guy.</font>

558
00:34:52,590 --> 00:34:53,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See if there's any opportunity</font>

559
00:34:54,480 --> 00:34:55,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at Dongle for him.</font>

560
00:34:58,960 --> 00:34:59,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Tianbao.</font>

561
00:35:02,190 --> 00:35:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Tianbao.</font>

562
00:35:03,760 --> 00:35:04,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Long time no see.</font>

563
00:35:04,760 --> 00:35:05,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Long time no see.</font>

564
00:35:05,670 --> 00:35:06,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for saving me.</font>

565
00:35:06,880 --> 00:35:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're welcome.</font>

566
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang.</font>

567
00:35:11,630 --> 00:35:12,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Iron head.</font>

568
00:35:13,590 --> 00:35:14,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

569
00:35:14,710 --> 00:35:15,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom.</font>

570
00:35:15,840 --> 00:35:16,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He</font>

571
00:35:17,150 --> 00:35:17,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is good.</font>

572
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:26,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle needs a business manager.</font>

573
00:35:27,070 --> 00:35:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can give it a try first.</font>

574
00:35:30,000 --> 00:35:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't have experience in this area.</font>

575
00:35:31,840 --> 00:35:32,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid I won't do well.</font>

576
00:35:33,630 --> 00:35:34,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No experience needed.</font>

577
00:35:34,840 --> 00:35:35,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen more, watch more.</font>

578
00:35:36,800 --> 00:35:37,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The most important thing</font>

579
00:35:38,920 --> 00:35:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is to keep your mouth shut.</font>

580
00:35:42,400 --> 00:35:43,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank her.</font>

581
00:35:44,880 --> 00:35:45,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Ahong.</font>

582
00:35:46,150 --> 00:35:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Tianbao.</font>

583
00:35:48,480 --> 00:35:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

584
00:35:49,150 --> 00:35:50,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait for me outside.</font>

585
00:35:51,280 --> 00:35:51,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll walk you out.</font>

586
00:35:53,110 --> 00:35:54,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can your head be so hard?</font>

587
00:35:54,960 --> 00:35:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The smashing didn't hurt it at all.</font>

588
00:36:00,190 --> 00:36:02,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's Zhou Haiyang's background?</font>

589
00:36:03,760 --> 00:36:04,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

590
00:36:05,030 --> 00:36:06,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway, I can handle him.</font>

591
00:36:06,760 --> 00:36:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's not bad.</font>

592
00:36:08,760 --> 00:36:09,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you think?</font>

593
00:36:14,320 --> 00:36:15,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The last batch of goods was snatched.</font>

594
00:36:17,400 --> 00:36:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up and get the next batch out.</font>

595
00:36:19,760 --> 00:36:22,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, we can't answer
to Third Granduncle.</font>

596
00:36:24,320 --> 00:36:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful lately.</font>

597
00:36:26,150 --> 00:36:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The police here have their eyes on you.</font>

598
00:36:34,510 --> 00:36:36,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Endless towers and pavilions♪</font>

599
00:36:36,100 --> 00:36:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Crawling back and forth,
caught in a whirlpool♪</font>

600
00:36:37,600 --> 00:36:38,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The color of desire♪</font>

601
00:36:38,450 --> 00:36:39,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Is a golden lock♪</font>

602
00:36:39,880 --> 00:36:41,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪He must tell good from bad♪</font>

603
00:36:41,210 --> 00:36:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To unlock it♪</font>

604
00:36:42,680 --> 00:36:45,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Covering his eyes only for money♪</font>

605
00:36:45,300 --> 00:36:46,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Money is round; the hole is square♪</font>

606
00:36:46,660 --> 00:36:48,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪People have rules
beyond square and round♪</font>

607
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:49,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Heaven is round; the earth is square♪</font>

608
00:36:49,350 --> 00:36:50,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The universe is bright and clear♪</font>

609
00:36:50,770 --> 00:36:51,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No one♪</font>

610
00:36:51,370 --> 00:36:53,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Can choose to come back again♪</font>

611
00:36:53,490 --> 00:36:54,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Sleeping, seeing the light♪</font>

612
00:36:54,690 --> 00:36:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Walking in this world♪</font>

613
