00:37:01,460 --> 00:37:02,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Entering the world is round;
standing in the world is square♪</font>

618
00:37:02,850 --> 00:37:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Where to go, where to head♪</font>

619
00:37:04,200 --> 00:37:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Desire is round; the cage is square♪</font>

620
00:37:05,530 --> 00:37:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Walking in this world♪</font>

621
00:37:06,900 --> 00:37:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪People bend; principles stay square♪</font>

622
00:37:08,140 --> 00:37:09,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪People have rules
beyond square and round♪</font>

623
00:37:09,570 --> 00:37:10,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Flowing water is round;
mountain rocks are square♪</font>

624
00:37:10,950 --> 00:37:12,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The universe is bright and clear♪</font>

625
00:37:12,300 --> 00:37:13,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Entering the world is round;
standing in the world is square♪</font>

626
00:37:13,650 --> 00:37:14,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Where to go, where to head♪</font>

627
00:37:14,970 --> 00:37:16,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Desire is round; the cage is square♪</font>

628
00:37:16,410 --> 00:37:18,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Walking in this world♪</font>

629
00:37:30,510 --> 00:37:30,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yawen.</font>

630
00:37:31,550 --> 00:37:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd better think this through.</font>

631
00:37:32,440 --> 00:37:33,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You lead the inspection. I assist.</font>

632
00:37:34,030 --> 00:37:35,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When Chief Zhang asks me,</font>

633
00:37:35,150 --> 00:37:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll say you coerced and bribed me.</font>

634
00:37:36,760 --> 00:37:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway, all the responsibility
is on you in the end.</font>

635
00:37:38,480 --> 00:37:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

636
00:37:39,550 --> 00:37:40,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's exactly the idea.</font>

637
00:37:49,110 --> 00:37:49,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong.</font>

638
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:52,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The tax auditors are here.</font>

639
00:37:52,710 --> 00:37:54,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One is named Ouyang Xu.</font>

640
00:37:56,800 --> 00:37:57,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The finance team isn't here.</font>

641
00:37:58,150 --> 00:37:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't have the account books.</font>

642
00:37:59,320 --> 00:37:59,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

643
00:38:02,230 --> 00:38:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong, what's wrong?</font>

644
00:38:03,400 --> 00:38:04,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take Zhou Haiyang down with you.</font>

645
00:38:05,360 --> 00:38:05,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

646
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officers.</font>

647
00:38:23,360 --> 00:38:24,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry to keep you waiting, officers.</font>

648
00:38:26,960 --> 00:38:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry for the wait.</font>

649
00:38:27,800 --> 00:38:28,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really sorry.</font>

650
00:38:29,030 --> 00:38:29,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What would you like to drink?</font>

651
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:30,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about coffee?</font>

652
00:38:30,510 --> 00:38:32,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our coffee is very famous.</font>

653
00:38:32,710 --> 00:38:33,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about that?</font>

654
00:38:33,840 --> 00:38:34,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coffee?</font>

655
00:38:35,230 --> 00:38:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pass. I'm not used to it.</font>

656
00:38:36,880 --> 00:38:37,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

657
00:38:37,190 --> 00:38:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have a cup, thanks.</font>

658
00:38:38,800 --> 00:38:39,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

659
00:38:40,280 --> 00:38:42,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two are here today
to audit the books?</font>

660
00:38:43,000 --> 00:38:44,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haven't they been checked before?</font>

661
00:38:44,590 --> 00:38:45,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've seen them,</font>

662
00:38:45,920 --> 00:38:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but we're not very reassured.</font>

663
00:38:47,510 --> 00:38:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">According to our investigation,</font>

664
00:38:48,800 --> 00:38:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the smuggled goods Aike supplied to you</font>

665
00:38:50,480 --> 00:38:51,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were priced quite high.</font>

666
00:38:51,710 --> 00:38:52,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's right.</font>

667
00:38:53,630 --> 00:38:54,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please have a seat.</font>

668
00:38:55,480 --> 00:38:59,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Original invoices and purchase receipts</font>

669
00:38:59,360 --> 00:39:01,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have been checked
by the tax officers before.</font>

670
00:39:02,280 --> 00:39:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Also, we've reviewed</font>

671
00:39:04,360 --> 00:39:05,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">their company's qualifications</font>

672
00:39:05,670 --> 00:39:06,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the customs import documents.</font>

673
00:39:06,840 --> 00:39:09,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But as for the specific details inside,</font>

674
00:39:09,710 --> 00:39:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we really don't know.</font>

675
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:12,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me ask.</font>

676
00:39:12,400 --> 00:39:14,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't our Dongle also a victim?</font>

677
00:39:15,150 --> 00:39:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When buying things,</font>

678
00:39:16,550 --> 00:39:17,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you should compare prices
from different sellers.</font>

679
00:39:18,480 --> 00:39:20,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those goods Aike supplied to you</font>

680
00:39:20,510 --> 00:39:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were more than 50% pricier
than genuine goods.</font>

681
00:39:23,000 --> 00:39:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They were speculating and profiteering,</font>

682
00:39:24,280 --> 00:39:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">evading taxes.</font>

683
00:39:25,440 --> 00:39:27,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We now suspect you of inflating costs</font>

684
00:39:28,030 --> 00:39:28,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and evading taxes.</font>

685
00:39:29,190 --> 00:39:30,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Evading taxes?</font>

686
00:39:31,110 --> 00:39:31,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impossible.</font>

687
00:39:32,880 --> 00:39:35,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, you two came today...</font>

688
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:36,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To ask for your cooperation.</font>

689
00:39:37,150 --> 00:39:38,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We want to see the full books,</font>

690
00:39:38,710 --> 00:39:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">including customers' spending details,</font>

691
00:39:40,590 --> 00:39:41,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">top-up records,</font>

692
00:39:41,550 --> 00:39:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the transaction receipts issued.</font>

693
00:39:43,360 --> 00:39:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The invoice</font>

694
00:39:44,840 --> 00:39:46,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has four copies in total.</font>

695
00:39:46,360 --> 00:39:47,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One of them</font>

696
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:49,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is at your Tax Bureau.</font>

697
00:39:49,030 --> 00:39:50,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two work in taxation,</font>

698
00:39:50,030 --> 00:39:51,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you should know better than I do.</font>

699
00:39:51,630 --> 00:39:52,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you two want to check,</font>

700
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:55,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can go back to the bureau
and check carefully.</font>

701
00:39:55,510 --> 00:39:56,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about the ones without invoices?</font>

702
00:39:58,000 --> 00:39:59,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you please try to recall?</font>

703
00:39:59,630 --> 00:40:01,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For example, those with large amounts</font>

704
00:40:01,150 --> 00:40:02,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and those from high-level members.</font>

705
00:40:02,960 --> 00:40:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't know about that.</font>

706
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:05,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd have to ask the finance team.</font>

707
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:07,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But unfortunately,</font>

708
00:40:08,320 --> 00:40:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the finance team today</font>

709
00:40:09,440 --> 00:40:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is on annual leave.</font>

710
00:40:11,320 --> 00:40:12,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe you two could come back
another day.</font>

711
00:40:14,110 --> 00:40:15,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In such a big company,</font>

712
00:40:15,960 --> 00:40:17,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not a single finance person is on duty?</font>

713
00:40:17,150 --> 00:40:18,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That doesn't add up.</font>

714
00:40:18,150 --> 00:40:18,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're really not here.</font>

715
00:40:20,480 --> 00:40:21,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then when does this annual leave end?</font>

716
00:40:22,110 --> 00:40:22,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not sure.</font>

717
00:40:23,800 --> 00:40:24,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides the finance team,</font>

718
00:40:24,960 --> 00:40:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who else can see the account books?</font>

719
00:40:27,440 --> 00:40:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

720
00:40:29,960 --> 00:40:31,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is your general manager?</font>

721
00:40:31,030 --> 00:40:31,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have a word with them.</font>

722
00:40:32,230 --> 00:40:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The general manager</font>

723
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:34,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just went out.</font>

724
00:40:35,150 --> 00:40:35,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, no one's here, right?</font>

725
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:36,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

726
00:40:36,480 --> 00:40:37,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we'll wait here</font>

727
00:40:37,480 --> 00:40:38,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">until they come back.</font>

728
00:40:39,190 --> 00:40:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll wait?</font>

729
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:41,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's fine,</font>

730
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:44,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the area you two are sitting in now</font>

731
00:40:44,800 --> 00:40:46,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is our consumption area.</font>

732
00:40:47,000 --> 00:40:48,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, you'd have to spend money.</font>

733
00:40:50,590 --> 00:40:52,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem. I've brought everything.</font>

734
00:40:53,320 --> 00:40:56,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And our Dongle Manor is members-only.</font>

735
00:40:56,550 --> 00:40:58,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To ensure service quality,</font>

736
00:40:58,070 --> 00:40:59,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we don't accept walk-ins.</font>

737
00:40:59,280 --> 00:41:00,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're truly sorry.</font>

738
00:41:00,630 --> 00:41:01,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In that case,</font>

739
00:41:01,670 --> 00:41:03,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'd like to randomly</font>

740
00:41:03,070 --> 00:41:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">survey some Dongle members.</font>

741
00:41:05,280 --> 00:41:06,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please cooperate.</font>

742
00:41:08,110 --> 00:41:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, about that,</font>

743
00:41:09,670 --> 00:41:12,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you two should ask him.</font>

744
00:41:13,230 --> 00:41:15,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Manager Zhou,
our new business manager.</font>

745
00:41:18,800 --> 00:41:19,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, officers.</font>

746
00:41:19,630 --> 00:41:20,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My name is Zhou Haiyang.</font>

747
00:41:24,710 --> 00:41:26,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've also just come to Chunjiang
from out of town.</font>

748
00:41:27,110 --> 00:41:29,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not too familiar
with many things either.</font>

749
00:41:29,360 --> 00:41:30,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In our membership rules,</font>

750
00:41:30,880 --> 00:41:31,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's one regulation.</font>

751
00:41:32,190 --> 00:41:33,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Member information cannot be disclosed.</font>

752
00:41:33,880 --> 00:41:35,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And we can't disturb the guests.</font>

753
00:41:35,710 --> 00:41:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have the right
to protect their privacy.</font>

754
00:41:38,230 --> 00:41:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please understand, officers.</font>

755
00:41:44,880 --> 00:41:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're really sorry.</font>

756
00:41:48,230 --> 00:41:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your manor is truly impressive.</font>

757
00:41:51,800 --> 00:41:54,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impressive.
Didn't you see those clients just now?</font>

758
00:41:54,510 --> 00:41:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're all wealthy and powerful.</font>

759
00:41:56,280 --> 00:41:57,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't say that.</font>

760
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:59,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We mainly serve business people</font>

761
00:41:59,230 --> 00:42:00,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and foreign guests.</font>

762
00:42:00,360 --> 00:42:01,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mainly serve
those big spenders, right?</font>

763
00:42:02,320 --> 00:42:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ordinary membership fees</font>

764
00:42:03,760 --> 00:42:05,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can't support such a large operation.</font>

765
00:42:07,960 --> 00:42:10,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just a small manager,</font>

766
00:42:10,150 --> 00:42:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only in charge of reception.</font>

767
00:42:11,360 --> 00:42:12,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for operations,</font>

768
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that's not my area of work.</font>

769
00:42:15,030 --> 00:42:16,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really sorry about today.</font>

770
00:42:16,960 --> 00:42:18,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tax officers,</font>

771
00:42:18,400 --> 00:42:19,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">next time you come,</font>

772
00:42:19,150 --> 00:42:20,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">give us a heads-up first,</font>

773
00:42:20,800 --> 00:42:22,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and we'll definitely cooperate fully.</font>

774
00:42:22,670 --> 00:42:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid I can't treat you
to coffee today.</font>

775
00:42:25,400 --> 00:42:26,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

776
00:42:26,070 --> 00:42:26,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Manager Zhou.</font>

777
00:42:28,110 --> 00:42:28,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See the guests out.</font>

778
00:42:28,800 --> 00:42:29,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

779
00:42:32,760 --> 00:42:33,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, officers,</font>

780
00:42:34,070 --> 00:42:35,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's leave it here for today.
This way, please.</font>

781
00:42:38,030 --> 00:42:38,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way.</font>

782
00:42:44,440 --> 00:42:45,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

783
00:42:51,030 --> 00:42:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

784
00:42:52,280 --> 00:42:53,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you go back first?</font>

785
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:55,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll talk another day.</font>

786
00:43:31,150 --> 00:43:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Why do you need to hide♪</font>

787
00:43:33,270 --> 00:43:34,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪So♪</font>

788
00:43:35,240 --> 00:43:37,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Ordinary and simple♪</font>

789
00:43:38,270 --> 00:43:42,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I dare not look back on those days♪</font>

790
00:43:42,350 --> 00:43:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Clinging to broken wholeness♪</font>

791
00:43:45,970 --> 00:43:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The strength of worrying
about gain and loss♪</font>

792
00:43:49,040 --> 00:43:51,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Breaking means courage♪</font>

793
00:43:52,640 --> 00:43:56,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The ambitious young man♪</font>

794
00:43:56,650 --> 00:43:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Accompanied by loneliness♪</font>

795
00:43:59,550 --> 00:44:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Breaking through the tracks of time♪</font>

796
00:44:03,180 --> 00:44:06,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The remnants of dreams are uproaring♪</font>

797
00:44:07,080 --> 00:44:10,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At my lowest moments, I always look up♪</font>

798
00:44:10,980 --> 00:44:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more begging♪</font>

799
00:44:14,520 --> 00:44:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Wind is in my arms; the time is right♪</font>

800
00:44:21,330 --> 00:44:25,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Those years remain spotless
in my heart♪</font>

801
00:44:25,230 --> 00:44:27,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No one knows♪</font>

802
00:44:27,930 --> 00:44:31,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Set out♪</font>

803
00:44:31,110 --> 00:44:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Take off all the armor♪</font>

804
00:44:35,570 --> 00:44:37,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more regret♪</font>

805
00:44:37,460 --> 00:44:39,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more complaining♪</font>

806
00:44:39,310 --> 00:44:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more begging for mercy
in humiliation♪</font>

807
00:44:43,400 --> 00:44:49,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Wind is in my arms; the time is right♪</font>

808
00:44:49,900 --> 00:44:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Those years remain spotless
in my heart♪</font>

809
00:44:53,940 --> 00:44:56,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No one knows♪</font>

810
00:44:56,620 --> 00:44:59,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Set out♪</font>

811
00:44:59,780 --> 00:45:02,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Even if I fall again♪</font>

812
00:45:03,870 --> 00:45:05,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more regret♪</font>

813
00:45:05,630 --> 00:45:07,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more complaining♪</font>

814
00:45:07,440 --> 00:45:15,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more begging anyone for mercy♪</font>
